{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/baaadea9a746150e95e4935004e0ff52.webp?t=1771730536\" width=1200 height=8 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abject Abyss is a first-person sci-fi horror adventure about isolation, discovery, and humanity's insignificance in a vast uncaring void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/baaadea9a746150e95e4935004e0ff52.webp?t=1771730536\" width=1200 height=8 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/9757e44fa71df3f2e47bea50471dbc22.poster.avif?t=1771730536\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/9757e44fa71df3f2e47bea50471dbc22.webm?t=1771730536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/9757e44fa71df3f2e47bea50471dbc22.mp4?t=1771730536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/baaadea9a746150e95e4935004e0ff52.webp?t=1771730536\" width=1200 height=8 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a distant research facility on the edge of charted space, far from civilisation. Search dark corners for stims, lost key fobs, vital notes, and other tools that might keep you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/baaadea9a746150e95e4935004e0ff52.webp?t=1771730536\" width=1200 height=8 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/19d6ede310a3dc6c3d35f3c895b4b56a.poster.avif?t=1771730536\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/19d6ede310a3dc6c3d35f3c895b4b56a.webm?t=1771730536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/19d6ede310a3dc6c3d35f3c895b4b56a.mp4?t=1771730536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/baaadea9a746150e95e4935004e0ff52.webp?t=1771730536\" width=1200 height=8 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a lone technician you\u2019ll navigate claustrophobic crawlspaces, lightless hallways, and frozen tundra, facing a multitude of dangers along the way. Stay hidden, stay quiet, and when things go bad, run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/baaadea9a746150e95e4935004e0ff52.webp?t=1771730536\" width=1200 height=8 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/8eeae092ed230cec16e21f240f42cca9.poster.avif?t=1771730536\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/8eeae092ed230cec16e21f240f42cca9.webm?t=1771730536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/8eeae092ed230cec16e21f240f42cca9.mp4?t=1771730536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/baaadea9a746150e95e4935004e0ff52.webp?t=1771730536\" width=1200 height=8 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From unlocking doors to restarting a failing reactor, use your wits and technical know-how to push forward, and escape Marzanna before it\u2019s too late. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/baaadea9a746150e95e4935004e0ff52.webp?t=1771730536\" width=1200 height=8 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense first-person exploration</strong> through dark corridors, maintenance shafts, and frozen wastes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth-focused encounters</strong> where noise and light are critical to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools and items to collect</strong> in classic adventure game fashion, without encumbrance or limited space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A focus on atmosphere</strong>, a short immersive experience that starts calm and ramps up greatly towards the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3353810?t=1771730536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3353810?t=1771730536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/660baad43615c4064511431f58607d6030b99a7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771730536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/660baad43615c4064511431f58607d6030b99a7a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771730536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains strong horror themes, Body-horror, gore (such as corpses), and depictions of violence."},"demos":[{"appid":3822880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/baaadea9a746150e95e4935004e0ff52.webp?t=1771730536\" width=1200 height=8 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abject Abyss is a first-person sci-fi horror adventure about isolation, discovery, and humanity's insignificance in a vast uncaring void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/baaadea9a746150e95e4935004e0ff52.webp?t=1771730536\" width=1200 height=8 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/9757e44fa71df3f2e47bea50471dbc22.poster.avif?t=1771730536\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/9757e44fa71df3f2e47bea50471dbc22.webm?t=1771730536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/9757e44fa71df3f2e47bea50471dbc22.mp4?t=1771730536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/baaadea9a746150e95e4935004e0ff52.webp?t=1771730536\" width=1200 height=8 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a distant research facility on the edge of charted space, far from civilisation. Search dark corners for stims, lost key fobs, vital notes, and other tools that might keep you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/baaadea9a746150e95e4935004e0ff52.webp?t=1771730536\" width=1200 height=8 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/19d6ede310a3dc6c3d35f3c895b4b56a.poster.avif?t=1771730536\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/19d6ede310a3dc6c3d35f3c895b4b56a.webm?t=1771730536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/19d6ede310a3dc6c3d35f3c895b4b56a.mp4?t=1771730536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/baaadea9a746150e95e4935004e0ff52.webp?t=1771730536\" width=1200 height=8 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a lone technician you\u2019ll navigate claustrophobic crawlspaces, lightless hallways, and frozen tundra, facing a multitude of dangers along the way. Stay hidden, stay quiet, and when things go bad, run.</p><p class=\"bb_p