s and items to collect</strong> in classic adventure game fashion, without encumbrance or limited space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A focus on atmosphere</strong>, a short immersive experience that starts calm and ramps up greatly towards the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Anton Bezett"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/00e3a09ca79ed11b74eec6ce5cf8fb0229e1d0f7/header.jpg?t=1771730536","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Anton Bezett. All rights reserved.<br />\r\n\"Abject Abyss\" and all associated content are trademarks of Anton Bezett.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game may contain third-party assets used under license. All trademarks are property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3353810/597159050/55259a13205333d230a83491fe4036a722d399e9/1750843011/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750879993","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3353810/597159050/55259a13205333d230a83491fe4036a722d399e9/1750843011/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750879993","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3353810/597159050/55259a13205333d230a83491fe4036a722d399e9/1750843011/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750879993","id":257157159,"name":"Abject Abyss Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257157159/1593dc19a2029373d0a1dca23f0d1b7993965f63/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750879993"}],"name":"Abject Aby